Global Application Logger

-> Building a multi-threaded enterprise application that needs to log
   events, warnings, and errors to a single text file. If multiple parts
   of the application try to open and write to this file simultaneously,
   it will cause file-locking crashes and corrupted data.

 -> Task: To create a Logger ckass that gurantees only one instance can ever
          exist during the application's lifecycle.
    1. Ensure that no matter how many times a client requests the logger, they
       get the same instance
    2. Make sure your implemented is thread safe so that concurrent threads
       dont accidentally create two instances